      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "a70dfcab-1e90-5604-a814-029157f95a19",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Geoffrey S. Fletcher, Saoirse Ronan, Alexis Bledel, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Danny Trejo, James Gandolfini, Julio DePietro, Dante Di Loreto, Scott Porter, Bryan Greenberg\n- Films: Violet & Daisy, Precious, The Good Guy, Temple Grandin, The Normal Heart\n- TV Series: The Handmaid's Tale\n- Awards: Oscar for Best Adapted Screenplay, Primetime Emmy Award\n\nFacts:\n- In 2009, the romantic comedy film The Good Guy was directed by Julio DePietro and starred Alexis Bledel, Scott Porter, and Bryan Greenberg.\n- In 2011, Violet & Daisy was released as an American comedy crime drama film written, produced, and directed by Geoffrey S. Fletcher in his directorial debut.\n- Before directing Violet & Daisy, Geoffrey S. Fletcher won the Oscar for Best Adapted Screenplay for Precious.\n- Violet & Daisy starred Saoirse Ronan, Alexis Bledel, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Danny Trejo, and James Gandolfini.\n- James Gandolfini's role in Violet & Daisy was one of his last acting roles before his death on June 19, 2013.\n- Alexis Bledel, born Kimberly Alexis Bledel on September 16, 1981, is an American actress and model.\n- Alexis Bledel won a Primetime Emmy Award for her work on the Hulu drama series The Handmaid's Tale.\n- Dante Di Loreto is a two-time Primetime Emmy Award winner for Temple Grandin and The Normal Heart.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
